nt,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软给 Copilot 智能体装上“刹车”：发邮件、付款前必须人工点头</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI正式发布前沿大模型GPT-6 Astra，多项基准测试实现性能领跑</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta调整工程师AI绩效考核标准，取消Token用量指标并强调代码交付质量</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里千问办公上线首月用户破3000万并开源MyContext上下文底座</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1cef188670e7b6d944c825255d07c787.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里旗下AI办公产品“千问办公”（QwenWork）上线首月用户数突破3000万，其中企业用户占比超50%。该产品在30天内完成120个版本迭代，并正式开源企业上下文基础设施MyContext，旨在将IM、文档、审批及邮件等异构数据转化为Agent可调用的上下文，目前GitHub已获超3000 Star。技术层面，千问办公联合千问大模型团队推出办公专属模型Qwen3.8-Flash，通过针对多步规划与上下文压缩的专项调优，实现单任务生成速度提升约100%，Token消耗平均减少75%。通过与钉钉深度打通，该产品已支持跨CRM、ERP系统进行数据查询与业务建议。目前，长安汽车、汇付天下、老乡鸡等企业已接入使用，其中长安汽车的线束选型计算效率从两天缩短至5分钟，显著提升了企业核心业务的自动化处理能力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达开源 Personal AI Router 软件，实现局域网内 AI 算力调度</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ce8205aaeca0cbb826530bca9ea0783a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达正式开源 Personal AI Router（PAIR）测试版，旨在通过局域网调度机制，将多台 Mac、RTX PC 及 DGX Spark 整合为统一的本地 AI 算力集群。该软件支持 M4 及以上芯片的 Mac 与英伟达 RTX 设备，可为 Ollama 和 LM Studio 等本地 AI 工具提供统一请求入口。PAIR 能够自动发现局域网内设备，当某台机器繁忙时，自动将 AI 请求分派至空闲设备处理，有效实现并发负载分担。英伟达强调，该机制侧重于多任务并行处理，而非提升单次回复速度。实测数据显示，在运行 Qwen 3.6 35B A3B 模型时，通过 PAIR 将任务拆分至 5 个子智能体，任务完成时间从单机运行的 18 分钟缩短至 8 分 48 秒。此举简化了多设备 AI 环境的配置流程，用户</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软给 Copilot 智能体装上“刹车”：发邮件、付款前必须人工点头</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6cac54587de973a64b1801adb05b2d26.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软给 Copilot 智能体装上“刹车”：发邮件、付款前必须人工点头AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Sep 4, 20264微软计划从 9 月开始推送 Copilot Studio 调整，AI 智能体在调用工具前将需要经过人工批准。Copilot Studio 是微软用于搭建和管理 AI 智能体的平台，可让智能体连接邮件、工单、支付等业务工具。微软在官方介绍中表示，Copilot Studio 现在允许开发者在 AI 智能体运行特定工具前要求人工审批。通过针对每个工具和每个智能体的开关，任何需要人工审批的工具调用都会暂停，并显示审批请求，说明智能体的意图，以便用户在操作执行前进行批准、批准会话或拒绝。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI正式发布前沿大模型GPT-6 Astra，多项基准测试实现性能领跑</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/96a1bae977b7f3e2593c5df65697f51c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于9月3日正式发布前沿大模型GPT-6 Astra，标志着行业迈入AGI时代。该模型在软件工程、科学及网络安全领域实现代际飞跃，是首个达到OpenAI“准备框架”关键网络安全能力阈值的模型。性能方面，Astra在ARC-AGI-3测试中取得98.6%得分，在FrontierMath Tier4(v2)中得分97.6%，并在GPQA Diamond、DeepSWE v1.1等多项基准测试中全面领跑。Astra配备了全新的监控功能以强化安全防护，能更可靠地拒绝有害网络请求。目前，该模型已向OpenAI Daybreak项目的企业安全客户开放，未来几天将陆续面向ChatGPT Plus、Pro、Business及Enterprise订阅用户推出。定价为每百万输入代币10美元、每百万输出代币50美元。Ast</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta调整工程师AI绩效考核标准，取消Token用量指标并强调代码交付质量</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/39ed27ad5f25d68f732e3d0b20af20b3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta已正式调整内部工程师绩效评估标准，明确不再将AI Token使用量或AI采用率仪表盘作为衡量员工影响力的指标。公司高管Maher Saba与Santosh Janardhan联合发布的最新备忘录显示，考核重心已转向工作质量与实际交付效率。目前，Meta内部已有93%的代码变更由AI智能体辅助完成。此次政策调整标志着公司从单纯追求AI工具采用率，转向关注AI在提升代码质量与迭代速度方面的实际产出。此前，Meta曾通过AI Gateway平台监控各团队Token支出，并对异常增长发出警报。随着内部AI使用量激增，预计今年相关工具支出将达数百亿美元。此次考核改革旨在引导工程师更理性地利用AI工具，以实现更高质量的软件交付，而非单纯追求AI使用规模。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
